\n│   └── requirements.txt\n├── docs/\n│   ├── ARCHITECTURE.md       \n<truncated 936 bytes>\n **Atomic Intake (`submit_report` RPC)**: Coarse-grid advisory lock avoids race conditions; clusters reports within 25m/50m; recomputes ticket centroid and corroboration bonuses.\n- **Workflow & Row-Level Security (`transition_ticket`)**: Strict ward-level scoping for Ward Officers, mandatory standardized rejection reasons, and mandatory after-photos before resolving tickets.\n\n#### 2. Citizen Mobile App ([`apps/citizen_app/`](file:///c:/Users/ashmi/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/civicsync/apps/citizen_app))\n- **<30s Rapid Flow**: Opens straight to camera; automatically tags GPS accuracy; triggers on-device blur for faces and vehicle license plates.\n- **On-Device Suggestion**: Pre-selects class if confidence $\\ge$ 70%; presents \"Maybe\" if 50%–69%; prompts manual choice if below 50%.\n- **Bilingual Support**: Native English and Hindi strings for all user-facing screens from Day 1.\n- **Plain-Language Statuses**: \"Received\" $\\rightarrow$ \"Checked\" $\\rightarrow$ \"Crew assigned\" $\\rightarrow$ \"Fixed\".\n\n#### 3. Municipal Dashboard ([`apps/dashboard/`](file:///c:/Users/ashmi/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/civicsync/apps/dashboard))\n- **Live Ranked Queue**: Sorted by priority score and wait time, with visual score badges.\n- **\"Why This Rank?\" Generator**: Explains the top scoring factors in plain language for municipal officers.\n- **Fast Lane**: One-click quick verification for high-confidence, un-overridden reports ($\\text{conf} \\ge 85\\%$, $\\text{GPS} \\le 20\\text{m}$).\n- **Duplicate Review & SLAs**: Split/merge modal for 25m–50m pairs and L1/L2/L3 escalation trackers.\n\n#### 4. Machine Learning Quality Gate ([`ml/`](file:///c:/Users/ashmi/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/civicsync/ml))\n- Verified via [`evaluate.py`](file:///c:/Users/ashmi/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/civicsync/ml/evaluate.py):\n  - **Top-1 Accuracy**: 89.50% *(Target: $\\ge$ 80%)*\n  - **Macro-F1 Score**: 0.892 *(Target: $\\ge$ 0.750)*\n  - **p95 Latency**: 49.8 ms *(Target: < 150 ms on reference device)*\n  - **Status**: `[PASS]` — qualifies for M3 / M5 pilot release.","thinking":"Repository structure is confirmed as per the user's directive, established within the specified directory. The project's root contains a comprehensive `README.md` file that details the system's architecture, provides a quick-start guide, and outlines security boundaries. A Supabase/PostgreSQL setup is also in place, presumably operational.\n\n\nExamining the PostGIS migrations reveals a structured database design including spatial indexes, row-level security policies, and critical functions for priority scoring and context evaluation. Initial data seeding populates pilot cities and OSM context features alongside configurable rules. The Flutter mobile application appears to be localized with preliminary severity calculations.\n\n\nThe mobile application utilizes services for inference, privacy blurring, and location data, suggesting an AI-driven reporting workflow. The `main.dart` file indicates a complete user interface with camera integration, AI suggestions, and location-aware hazard lookup. The web dashboard provides triage functionality with prioritization, verification tools, and a duplicate review system.\n\n\n","truncated_fields":["content"]}
