{"step_index":140,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-29T15:03:57Z","input_tokens":2222,"cache_read_tokens":142644,"output_tokens":1126,"content":"### CivicSync Progress Update\n\nWe have continued implementation across all pillars of the system:\n\n---\n\n### 1. Verification Test Suite (`tests/test_civicsync_core.py`)\nAll core mathematical models and state machine rules have been implemented and verified with automated tests:\n```text\n.......\nRan 7 tests in 0.000s\nOK\n```\n- **Worked Examples from `RULES.pdf` §1.8**:\n  - *Case 1* (Large pothole, main road, 0.90 confidence) $\\rightarrow$ **Score 90, Critical**.\n  - *Case 2* (Medium waterlogging, residential lane, 0.70 confidence) $\\rightarrow$ **Score 53, Medium**.\n  - *Case 3* (Same waterlogging with 4 distinct reporters) $\\rightarrow$ **Score 62, High** ($+9$ corroboration bonus).\n  - *Case 4* (Small broken road near school, 0.80 confidence) $\\rightarrow$ **Score 68, High**.\n- **Duplicate Spatial Clustering**: Verified 25m auto-merge, 25m–50m candidate review, accuracy fallback (>30m), and compatibility group isolation.\n- **Workflow State Machine**: Verified role-based verification checks, mandatory after-photo resolution barrier, and double-reopened ticket instant L2 escalation.\n\n---\n\n### 2. Offline Database & Background Worker (`apps/citizen_app/`)\n- [`local_database.dart`](file:///c:/Users/ashmi/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/civicsync/apps/citizen_app/lib/data/local_database.dart):\n  - Local FIFO SQLite/Drift queue capped at 200 items.\n  - Automatic 7-day stale report expiration.\n  - Exponential retry backoff protocol: $30\\text{s} \\rightarrow 2\\text{m} \\rightarrow 10\\text{m} \\rightarrow 1\\text{h} \\rightarrow \\text{daily}$.\n- [`sync_worker.dart`](file:///c:/Users/ashmi/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/civicsync/apps/citizen_app/lib/services/sync_worker.dart):\n  - Listens to system connectivity transitions (`connectivity_plus`).\n  - Implements the 2-step upload protocol: private bucket photo upload $\\rightarrow$ `submit_report` RPC.\n\n---\n\n### 3. OpenStreetMap Ingestion Pipeline (`scripts/osm_ingest.py`)\n- Automated ingestion tool targeting Agra and Jodhpur bounding boxes.\n- Extracts schools, hospitals, primary/secondary road arteries, and transit hubs into PostGIS geometries.\n- Generated migration: [`20261029000002_osm_context_features.sql`](file:///c:/Users/ashmi/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/civicsync/supabase/migrations/20261029000002_osm_context_features.sql).\n\n---\n\n### 4. Complete Specification Package (`docs/`)\nExtracted and formatted markdown specifications for team version control:\n- [**`ARCHITECTURE.md`**](file:///c:/Users/ashmi/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/civicsync/docs/ARCHITECTURE.md): Component diagrams, 4 layers, state machine, and PostGIS entity relationships.\n- [**`PRD.md`**](file:///c:/Users/ashmi/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/civicsync/docs/PRD.md): User personas, functional requirements (FR-C1–FR-C11, FR-M1–FR-M8), and success metrics.\n- [**`TRD.md`**](file:///c:/Users/ashmi/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/civicsync/docs/TRD.md): Hardware references, RPC interfaces, and network latency budgets.\n- [**`RULES.md`**](file:///c:/Users/ashmi/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/civicsync/docs/RULES.md): Scoring formulas, duplicate thresholds, working hours SLA matrix, and DPDP data retention tables.\n- [**`SECURITY.md`**](file:///c:/Users/ashmi/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/civicsync/docs/SECURITY.md): Threat model (STRIDE), RLS permission matrix, and privacy blurring standards.\n- [**`ROADMAP.md`**](file:///c:/Users/ashmi/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/civicsync/docs/ROADMAP.md): 75-day sprint breakdown from Step Zero to Sprint 5 M5 validated prototype.\n\n---\n\n### Workspace Reminder\nTo work directly on the codebase, open:\n`C:\\Users\\ashmi\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\civicsync`"}
